PostgreSQL: SELECT "id", ("embedding" <=> CAST($1 AS vector)) AS "distance" FROM "documents" WHERE (("embedding" <=> CAST($2 AS vector))) <= $3 ORDER BY ("embedding" <=> CAST($4 AS vector)) ASC LIMIT $5
  values: [String(Some("[0.25,-1.5,3]")), String(Some("[0.25,-1.5,3]")), Double(Some(0.25)), String(Some("[0.25,-1.5,3]")), BigUnsigned(Some(5))]
MySQL: SELECT `id`, VEC_DISTANCE_COSINE(`embedding`, VEC_FromText(?)) AS `distance` FROM `documents` WHERE (VEC_DISTANCE_COSINE(`embedding`, VEC_FromText(?))) <= ? ORDER BY VEC_DISTANCE_COSINE(`embedding`, VEC_FromText(?)) ASC LIMIT ?
  values: [String(Some("[0.25,-1.5,3]")), String(Some("[0.25,-1.5,3]")), Double(Some(0.25)), String(Some("[0.25,-1.5,3]")), BigUnsigned(Some(5))]
SQLite: error: a vector distance is not supported on SQLite
